Package: surveystats
Title: Survey Analysis from Indicator Registers
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Geoffrey", family = "Manda", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides base R survey design construction and weighted analysis
    from indicator registers, including stratified cluster variance estimates
    for proportions, means, and totals.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
URL: https://github.com/GeoffreyManda/surveystats
